prompt Keaton pasted the Sound seat card: the fixed star holds the interface half of Grain in Glow and the language custody, where a rune ruling meets him directly.
think The lap chose itself. Silence's crashed round had split its find by lane per the charter and left the deeper half named for Sound's custody: eight pair desks whose generated main compared the gate to a textual copy of itself. Reading glow/lower_shop_gate.rye found the disease at three sites, one of which confessed in its own comment -- body and expect share one expression. The pair site, the call_one vane plants, and identity all emitted expect from the same format arguments as the gate body: exit 0 for every input, nothing spoken, a wall that could not be seen to refuse.
think The repair is subtraction into the shape the file already carried. The fold family's comment says it whole -- EXIT:0 + spoken answer prove it -- so all three sites now emit the speaking main, a new two-face emit_argv2_speaking_main sits beside its one-face sibling, and emit_argv_main is DELETED rather than fixed, its grave comment naming why: deleting the emitter makes the tautology unwritable. An oracle derived from the implementation it checks is the implementation, twice.
think The witness above the desks was the second half of the blindness. glow_vane_pair_mirrors closed on every-edge-exact while asserting only .ok, and Rishi contains is a substring test the worker's EXIT:0 tail feeds for free. It asserts the exact first-line spoken digit per side now -- trimmed equality, never contains -- eight sides, three refusals among them, each matching its gate's own placard.
obs Proven on metal at both edges before the witness was touched: gardens_lawful 8->1 9->0, caps pair (3,8)->1 (9,8)->0 (8,8)->1, mantra floor (3,2)->0 exactly as its placard example line reads. Regressions all GREEN: argv, sample, pair-faces, pair-select, tally-pair, tend-unary, rune-shape, and the TAME gates over the touched module.
obs zsh cost one detour again -- set -- $t does not word-split, so a whole test string became one path and the worker refused it with its allowlist message; ${=t} split it true. The same host habit that hid the 424-file find earlier in the week.
obs %309 folded within its own day to make room for %310 -- a red that dies discovering the next red is the ledger working. The parked glow_gate_answer ratchet remains Silence's half, counting the remaining contains-shaped walls tree-wide when its lap adopts the park.
